### 3. Generate RDF Triples Describing the Scene (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix : <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:Scene1 a :UrbanDrivingScene ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :ClearWeather ;
    :hasTimeOfDay :Daytime .

:ClearWeather a :WeatherCondition ;
    :temperature "25"^^xsd:integer ;
    :visibility "High" .

:Daytime a :TimeOfDay ;
    :lightCondition "Bright" .

:BlackCar a :Vehicle ;
    :vehicleType "Sedan" ;
    :color "Black" ;
    :position :Foreground ;
    :direction :Forward ;
    :lanePosition :RightLane .

:Ambulance a :Vehicle ;
    :vehicleType "Emergency" ;
    :color "White" ;
    :position :Background ;
    :direction :StationaryOrSlow .

:Building1 a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :type "HighRise" ;
    :location :Background .

:Building2 a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :type "LowRise" ;
    :location :RightSide .

:StreetLight1 a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :type "StreetLight" ;
    :location :Background .

:RoadMarkings a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :type "LaneMarkings" ;
    :description "Indicates lane directions" .

:BlackCar :approaching :Ambulance .
:BlackCar :near :Building2 .
:Ambulance :on :RoadMarkings .
```

